---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service for fknwine.com: 21+, how our deal checks work, affiliate disclosure, and the rules behind the honesty."
>
  <section class="wrapper" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5.5vw, 2.6rem);">Terms of Service</h1>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      fknwine.com („FKN Wine", „we") is an independent wine deals and reviews publication
      operated by Nimar Moradbakhti<br />
      Mauritiusstr. 4a<br />
      44789 Bochum, Germany<br />
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">2. Who may use this site</h2>
    <p>
      Adults only. You must be of legal drinking age in your jurisdiction (21+ in the United
      States). We don't target minors and we don't sell alcohol — we link to licensed merchants
      who verify age themselves.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">3. What we publish — and what we don't promise</h2>
    <p>
      We verify prices, offers and terms at the merchant on the „Checked" date shown on every
      deal. Prices and availability change; the merchant's own page is always the binding
      source. We don't publish tasting notes for wines we haven't tasted, and opinions are
      marked as opinions. Nothing on this site is financial, legal, or professional advice.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">4. Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links earn us a commission at no extra cost to you — see our
      <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>. Commissions never change verdicts: if a deal is
      bad, we say so (or don't publish it). Sponsored placements, when they exist, are clearly
      labeled, and sponsors never get to dictate review verdicts.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">5. Third-party offers</h2>
    <p>
      Deals, discounts and codes are provided by third-party merchants. Their terms, shipping
      rules, age verification and return policies apply. We are not the seller and not a party
      to your purchase.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">6. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      All content is © FKN Wine unless noted. You may quote with attribution and a link; bulk
      republication needs our written permission.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">7. Liability</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep everything accurate, but this site is provided „as is", without
      warranties. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for decisions or damages
      arising from use of this site or of third-party offers linked here. Mandatory statutory
      liability (e.g. under German law) remains unaffected.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">8. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms; the date below shows the current version. Continued use after
      changes means you accept them.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem;">9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>

    <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.6;">Last updated: October 16, 2026</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
